# Local secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copy to .dev.vars (setup.sh and `bun run dev:api` do this for you).
# .dev.vars is gitignored. Never commit real values.
#
# Production: cd apps/api && bunx wrangler secret put <NAME>
# Read in code as c.env.<NAME>; run `bun run --cwd apps/api cf-typegen` after adding one.
# Non-secret config goes in "vars" in wrangler.jsonc instead.

# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=replace-me
